#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:183 index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "desc"
msgstr "opis"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid "The long description of the skin"
msgstr "Dugi opis kože"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "fighters-flag-y-diff"
msgstr "borci-zastave-y-diff"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "The height difference between flags and cannons sprites"
msgstr "Razlika visina između zastava i topovskih sprajtova"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "width-between-flag-and-fighter"
msgstr "širina-između-zastave-i-borca"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The number of pixels between the left most pixel of the flag and the right "
"most pixel of the simple cannon (when not firing nor exploding)"
msgstr ""
"Broj piksela između lijevog najvećeg piksela zastave i desnog najvećeg "
"piksela od jednostavnog topa (kada  ne pucaju niti eksplodiraju)"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "The sprites description groups"
msgstr "Opisne grupe sprajtova"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each type of sprite (flag, infantry, cavalry, cannon, firing cannon and "
"exploding cannon) is defined by a group. Only some sprites have a width "
"entry. This entry is used for relative positioning during animations: the "
"cannons, firing or exploding should not \"move\" around the country's flag "
"during fight."
msgstr ""
"Svaki tip sprajtova (zastave, pješadije, konjica, top, pucaći top i "
"eksplodirajući top) je definiran od strane grupe. Samo neki sprajtovi imati "
"unos širinu. Ovaj unos se koristi za relativna pozicioniranja tijekom "
"animacije: topovi, pucajući ili eksplodirajući ne treba \"pomjerati\" oko "
"zastave zemlje za vrijeme borbe."

