msgstr "verzije"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "The number of versions of the flag sprites"
msgstr "Broj verzija zastava sprajtova"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid "The countries description groups"
msgstr "Opisne grupe država"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each country listed in the onu group, countries entry has its own group "
"whose label is the country name. The table below lists the entries of these "
"groups."
msgstr ""
"Svaka država je navedena u onu grupu, ulazak država ima svoju grupe čija je "
"oznaka ime države. Tabela ispod navodi unose ovih grupa."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "Country entries"
msgstr "Unos država"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:220 index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>id</entry>"
msgstr "<entry>id</entry>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The integer unique identification number of the country, must start at zero "
"(0)"
msgstr "Cijeli jedinstveni matični broj zemlje, mora početi od nule (0)"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "The displayed name of the country"
msgstr "Prikazani naziv države"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "&lt;sprite&gt;-point"
msgstr "&lt;sprajt&gt;-tačka"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each type of sprite (flag, infantry, etc.) in the country is displayed at a "
"certain position defined by this entry made of two integers separated by a "
"comma"
msgstr ""
"Svaki tip sprajta (zastava, pješadija, itd) u zemlji je prikazan na "
"određenoj poziciji definisanoj unosom dva cijela broja razdvojena zarezom"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "neighbours"
msgstr "komšije"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "The list of the ids of the neighbors of the current country"
msgstr "Lista ids komšija trenutne države"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "The nationalities description groups"
msgstr "Opis grupa nacionalnosti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each nationality listed in the onu group, nationalities entry has its own "
"group whose label is the nationality name. The table below lists the entries "
