#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "flag"
msgstr "zastava"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "The name of the country's flag sprite element in the onu SVG file"
msgstr "Naziv elementa zastave sprajta zemlje u onu SVG datoteku"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "The continents description groups"
msgstr "Opisne grupe kontinenata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each continent listed in the onu group, continents entry has its own group "
"whose label is the continent name. The table below lists the entries of "
"these groups."
msgstr ""
"Svaki kontinent navedene u onu grupu, unos kontinenata ima svoje grupe čija "
"je oznaka ime kontinenta. Tabela ispod navodi unose ovih grupa."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "Continent entries"
msgstr "Unosi kontinenata"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid "The name of the continent (e.g. Africa)"
msgstr "Ime kontinenta  (e.g. Afrika)"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "The integer unique identification number of the continent"
msgstr "Cijeli jedinstveni matični broj kontinenta"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "bonus"
msgstr "bonus"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The number of armies obtained at the end of the turn by the player owning "
"all the countries of the continent"
msgstr ""
"Broj vojski dobijen na kraju skretanja od strane igrača koji posjeduje sve "
